stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    state "Disconnected" as Off
    [*] --> Off
    Off --> Connecting : connect()
    Connecting --> check
    state check <<choice>>
    check --> Connected : handshake ok
    check --> Backoff : error
    Backoff --> Connecting : retry after delay
    Connected --> sync
    state sync <<fork>>
    sync --> Heartbeat
    sync --> Streaming
    Heartbeat --> merge
    Streaming --> merge
    state merge <<join>>
    merge --> Off : socket closed
    Off --> [*] : dispose()
